taskhealth (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release with client-daemon architecture.
  * Daemon (taskhealthd): Unix domain socket server, epoll event loop,
    cross-process thread registry, watchdog detection engine, /proc probes,
    alert output (stderr / syslog / log file / external script).
  * Client library (libtaskhealth): IPC protocol over SOCK_SEQPACKET,
    thread register / heartbeat / unregister / shutdown.
  * Detection: unexpected thread exit, futex deadlock, lock-wait timeout.
  * Zero external dependencies, dual-licensed (MIT library / GPL-2.0-or-later daemon).

 -- Lu Haoran <37183985@qq.com>  Tue, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
